edge0
=====

This project bundles or adapts the following third-party works:

mlx-lm (MIT License)
  - `src/edge0/backends/mlx/_impl/qwen3_next.py` is vendored from mlx-lm
    0.31.0 (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-lm), with additive hooks for
    prerouter routing and layer callbacks.  Non-prerouter paths are kept
    byte-identical to the upstream file.
  - mlx-lm is used at runtime for checkpoint / tokenizer loading.
  Copyright (c) 2023-2024 Apple Inc. and the mlx-lm contributors.

bailing_hybrid (Apache License 2.0)
  - `src/edge0/backends/mlx/_impl/bailing_hybrid.py` is vendored from the
    Ling 3.0 MLX implementation (rapid-mlx / Ling-3.0-tiny, Apache-2.0), with
    prerouter hook identifiers renamed for consistency with the framework.
  Copyright (c) the bailing / Ling MLX contributors.

mlx-vlm Muse Glimmer model (MIT License)
  - `src/edge0/backends/mlx/_impl/muse_glimmer.py` adapts the language-only
    Muse Glimmer architecture from mlx-vlm 0.6.12
    (https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm). The vision tower, adapter,
    projection, and multimodal input path are intentionally omitted.
  Copyright © 2025 Prince Canuma.

mlx-vlm Gemma 4 model code (MIT License)
  - `src/edge0/backends/mlx/_impl/gemma4.py` adapts the language-only
    Gemma 4 architecture from mlx-vlm 0.4.3
    (https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm). Vision, audio, video, perception,
    multimodal embedding, and multimodal input paths are intentionally omitted.
  Copyright © 2025 Prince Canuma.

Google Gemma 4 canonical chat template
  - `src/edge0/models/gemma4_31b_mlx/chat_template.jinja` is an attributed
    text-only adaptation of the canonical template shipped by
    `google/gemma-4-31B-it`. Gemma model weights are not included in Edge0
    and remain subject to the Gemma terms.

